gauo(){return"Project reminders"},
gatP(){return"How do I create or edit a project reminder?"},
gas1(){return"If you are the owner, open the gear next to the project name, choose Reminders beside the Project heading, then Add reminder. A reminder is a notification sent to members. Other Admin members cannot configure it. Save a new project before adding reminders."},
gas2(){return"Enter a name to identify the reminder and the message to send. Choose days and a time, check the preview and choose Save reminder. The notification shows the project, the word Reminder and your message. You can create several reminders and edit them with Edit reminder. They are saved separately from the project."},
gau1(){return"How do recurrence, delivery time and month-end dates work?"},
gasp(){return"Choose Weekly for one or more weekdays, or Monthly for one or more dates in the month. A reminder uses the same time for all selected days. Create separate reminders for different times. Times always follow Italian local time, even when you are abroad."},
gasq(){return"If a selected date does not exist in a month, the reminder is sent on the last available day: for example, the 31st becomes February 28 or 29. Dates that fall on the same day produce one delivery. Clock changes are automatic: a skipped spring time is shifted forward; a repeated autumn time uses standard time, without duplicate deliveries."},
gau0(){return"Who receives reminders? Can I include limited members?"},
gasn(){return"The reminder includes the owner and non-Limited members across all project groups. Turn on Include limited members in that reminder to include Limited members too. Belonging to several groups does not create duplicate notifications on one device; a person may receive it on several devices if enabled on each."},
gaso(){return"Save changes to members or roles first: the reminder uses saved information. Each recipient must have notifications enabled. The message is delivered in the language you wrote it, without automatic translation."},
gau_(){return"How do I pause or delete a reminder?"},
gasl(){return"Turn off the reminder\u2019s switch to pause deliveries. Its settings are kept: turn it back on to resume from the next scheduled date. To remove it, choose Delete reminder and confirm."},
gasm(){return"Pausing, editing or deleting a reminder cancels deliveries still waiting to be sent. A notification already being sent may still arrive; delivered notifications are not withdrawn. If you leave the editor without saving, you can discard your changes."},
gatZ(){return"Why is a reminder missing or late?"},
gasj(){return"Check that the reminder is enabled with the correct days and Italian local time. Limited recipients must also be included in its settings. Then check that the recipient has allowed and enabled notifications. With the app open, the message appears in a dialog; otherwise, it may appear as a device notification. Tapping it opens the project calendar."},
gask(){return"The time is the scheduled send time: the network, browser or device may delay arrival. After a service interruption, deliveries from the last hour may be recovered; older ones are skipped to avoid a burst of overdue notifications. If the problem continues, see the question about enabling notifications."},
