gakV(){return"More appointments could not be loaded. Try again."},
gal0(){return"Appointments with more than one band on the same day. Check the times before confirming new commitments."},
akW(a){return A.fx(a,null,this.a,null,"1 appointment loaded",""+a+" appointments loaded",null,"No appointments loaded")},
gatL(){return"Where can I see appointments from all my bands together?"},
garV(){return"Open My agenda from the calendar\u2019s \u22ee menu. It lists rehearsals and live shows you can see in active projects, from today through the next 12 months, with each band\u2019s name. Filter by project and type. Load more results continues the list; Refresh agenda reloads the data and needs a connection. Going back returns to the calendar you were viewing."},
garW(){return"Display options lets you include your personal unavailability and events you are not attending, which are initially hidden. Personal unavailability remains visible when filtering a band or event type; private notes remain yours alone. Project permissions also apply in the agenda, including those for Limited members. The warning indicates several bands on the same day, not a definite time overlap. Open an event and choose Show in calendar to go to its project and day."},
gasP(){return"How can we help?"},
gasO(){return"Search for an answer or choose a topic."},
