ga2a(){return"Activation not confirmed"},
gazw(){return"On this device"},
gazE(){return"Receive notifications"},
gazF(){return"Enable or disable Band Calendar alerts on this device."},
gazJ(){return"Project reminders"},
gazK(){return"Managed within each project"},
gazI(){return"Days, time and recipients depend on the settings of each project."},
gazG(){return"What should I check?"},
gazH(){return"Check that the reminder is active and that you are among its recipients. Limited members must be included using the project option. To receive the alert, notifications must also be enabled on this device."},
gazv(){return"How alerts are delivered"},
gazu(){return"With the app open, a message may appear in a popup. When the app is not open, a device notification may arrive. Network, browser and device conditions can delay delivery."},
garE(){return"The Notifications row in Settings shows the status and opens a dedicated screen. Under On this device, use Receive notifications; the top panel explains whether permission or a retry is needed. Activation not confirmed does not mean alerts are working: press Retry. If deactivation is incomplete, use Retry to finish it. Reminders are still configured within each project."},
gaxf(){return"Home Screen calendar"},
gaxd(){return"Your calendar on your Home Screen"},
gaxe(){return"View the month without opening the app every time."},
ga0Z(){return"Illustrative preview \xb7 sample data"},
gax8(){return"Demo band"},
gax6(){return"What the widget shows"},
gaxa(){return"Your month at a glance"},
gax9(){return"A calendar with projects and unavailability."},
gaxc(){return"Adjustable size"},
gaxb(){return"After adding it, touch and hold it and use the edges to resize it, if your phone supports this."},
gax5(){return"Back to Settings"},
gax4(){return"This feature is available in the Android app. To add the widget, open Band Calendar on your Android phone."},
gaqH(){return"The Home Screen calendar page shows an illustrative preview with sample data. Press Add to Home Screen and confirm in the prompt on your phone. Confirm on your phone indicates a request, not that the widget has already been added. If the prompt does not appear or the request fails, open How to add it manually. After adding it, touch and hold the widget to resize it, if your phone supports this."},
